'' A STD MODULE IN A SCAN. std/fs was a facade of exported macros until 2026-10-10 and is a
'' real module now: its public procedures and types are members of the alias, at their
'' declarations in the module's own files -- fs.PathJoin at fspath.tiko's -- and std/path's
'' folded names are still exported macros, whose ref is the function they name: DirName at
'' PathParent's declaration.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-scan --pkg-dir pkg -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/fs.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: [9] fspath.tiko
'' EXPECT-OUT: [13] fs.tiko
'' EXPECT-OUT: function PathJoin as ustring  @9:140:29
'' EXPECT-OUT: type FsError  @4:104:13
'' EXPECT-OUT: define DirName as PathParent  @13:42:9
'' EXPECT-OUT: ref=9:101
'' EXPECT-OUT: namespace fs  @0:3:14  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: diags: 0
